  "title": "Assist with Healing Skill Target Selection [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "回復スキルの対象選択をアシスト【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "d80839a17e3e9c385d907a0e3bccd2b69add5bd6ef200a76a81dc2516835e785",
      "translation": "Assist with Healing Skill Target Selection [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "d80839a17e3e9c385d907a0e3bccd2b69add5bd6ef200a76a81dc2516835e785"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "回復系スキル（アイテム）の選択時、自動的に最適な対象にカーソルが合わさるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "5055086b378414e52462dc042dc6555cd595129c45c5ee4feee4547cc9291455",
      "translation": "When selecting a healing skill (or item), the cursor automatically moves to the optimal target.",
      "contextHash": "5055086b378414e52462dc042dc6555cd595129c45c5ee4feee4547cc9291455"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "回復スキルは最もＨＰ（％）が減っている対象を選択",
      "sourceHash": "1c6529fadc23a6b0deaab3109367d9a738a7f742a984afd26dddf10e63ea0f73",
      "translation": "Healing skills select the target with the lowest HP (%)",
      "contextHash": "1c6529fadc23a6b0deaab3109367d9a738a7f742a984afd26dddf10e63ea0f73"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "蘇生スキルは戦闘不能者を選択",
      "sourceHash": "d41752ebf924ee65f6952c712332abdaa0300b502f78c6e5fdd0eeb3fa8b15a1",
      "translation": "Revival skills select incapacitated allies",
      "contextHash": "d41752ebf924ee65f6952c712332abdaa0300b502f78c6e5fdd0eeb3fa8b15a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ステート＆弱体の解除スキルは該当の対象を選択",
      "sourceHash": "1730051cb1a7d6d396bcd532f6adb6c20b9a45a521a17696cdbaec3405c0203f",
      "translation": "State and debuff removal skills select the applicable target",
      "contextHash": "1730051cb1a7d6d396bcd532f6adb6c20b9a45a521a17696cdbaec3405c0203f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、優先度は以下のようになっています。",
      "sourceHash": "79c123b47ac325119b5a44a322e10913e768eff73649ae69fcad57c42d8187ab",
      "translation": "The priorities are as follows.",
      "contextHash": "79c123b47ac325119b5a44a322e10913e768eff73649ae69fcad57c42d8187ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "蘇生＞ＨＰ回復＞ＭＰ回復＞ステート＆弱体解除",
      "sourceHash": "f04ade996dcf610d33101f82e314ed0dc5921e4e23067d495f57f87dd100d763",
      "translation": "Revive > HP Recovery > MP Recovery > Remove States & Debuffs",
      "contextHash": "f04ade996dcf610d33101f82e314ed0dc5921e4e23067d495f57f87dd100d763"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、ＨＰと毒を同時に回復できるスキルならば、毒ステートにかかっている対象ではなく、最もＨＰが減っている対象を優先して選択します。",
      "sourceHash": "8d562481fcba3e425f61f4e16617f036d9a70c39afd724468b55485abeb133d3",
      "translation": "For example, if a skill can restore both HP and poison, it prioritizes the target with the lowest HP rather than a target affected by the poison state.",
      "contextHash": "8d562481fcba3e425f61f4e16617f036d9a70c39afd724468b55485abeb133d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the function ON in the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
