    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "対象の選択優先度を下げる機能について、戦闘不能の敵が存在する場合に正しく機能しない不具合修正。（2025/07/22 ver1.011）",
      "sourceHash": "f54918da3d94c5b6fd267d3f31c8da76b7da0e3d20ddc01dec87b48a623b1484",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where the feature that lowers target selection priority did not function correctly when an incapacitated enemy was present. (2025/07/22 ver1.011)",
      "contextHash": "f54918da3d94c5b6fd267d3f31c8da76b7da0e3d20ddc01dec87b48a623b1484"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2024/12/09 -> 2025/06/03（ver1.00 -> 1.002）",
      "sourceHash": "4c67862a39335098e8ff51d3d3e3d7ff999e84deddc517ba03f41603bd7d1d6e",
      "translation": "2024/12/09 -> 2025/06/03 (ver1.00 -> 1.002) ",
      "contextHash": "4c67862a39335098e8ff51d3d3e3d7ff999e84deddc517ba03f41603bd7d1d6e"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "最大ＭＰ０のアクターがＭＰ回復のアシスト対象になってしまう不具合を修正。（2024/12/11 ver1.001）",
      "sourceHash": "30ba865f8b7985651c25bb43f4fcf7839546ff980909a8d8bc62302f7f9f9dce",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where an actor with 0 maximum MP became a target for MP recovery assistance. (2024/12/11 ver1.001)",
      "contextHash": "30ba865f8b7985651c25bb43f4fcf7839546ff980909a8d8bc62302f7f9f9dce"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-007",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "範囲が味方単体（無条件）の蘇生スキルがアシスト対象にならない不具合修正。（2025/06/03 ver1.002）",
      "sourceHash": "5735840d0d3405780b2a7ac40271679cd244ba1f2ceccf41b79ce9d2715bf688",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where revival skills targeting a single ally (no conditions) did not become eligible for assistance. (2025/06/03 ver1.002)",
      "contextHash": "5735840d0d3405780b2a7ac40271679cd244ba1f2ceccf41b79ce9d2715bf688"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ステートのメモ欄（Note of State）",
      "sourceHash": "52ac0d6295a54cdd0d63037e5851d32ae7d5aa3f998699bd3a4a0066dfbb72a6",
      "translation": "State Note Field (Note of State)",
      "contextHash": "52ac0d6295a54cdd0d63037e5851d32ae7d5aa3f998699bd3a4a0066dfbb72a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ステートにかかった対象の選択優先度を下げます。",
      "sourceHash": "ec7607131f776fe31a84d161c58a1152bb76ca03c36d98e0b05d6302dc6eefea",
      "translation": "Lowers the selection priority of targets affected by the state.",
      "contextHash": "ec7607131f776fe31a84d161c58a1152bb76ca03c36d98e0b05d6302dc6eefea"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※選択自体は可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "167f3c34cac6e838078f7cfbce7cb940bbb2b25f2b94ef9b929f1c83af97ce0c",
      "translation": "※The target can still be selected.",
      "contextHash": "167f3c34cac6e838078f7cfbce7cb940bbb2b25f2b94ef9b929f1c83af97ce0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＨＰ回復に適用（ApplyHpHeal）",
      "sourceHash": "f7676bdeb4f7f62f9d7b2395a158f53719b7f6249f2b9ce335c8224a6e9741ed",
      "translation": "Apply to HP Recovery (ApplyHpHeal)",
      "contextHash": "f7676bdeb4f7f62f9d7b2395a158f53719b7f6249f2b9ce335c8224a6e9741ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＨＰ回復スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "53fae00f53a71fc5a5aabccbdfb1429825e017cf78a66c41e85684a3aae85967",
      "translation": "Applies the assistance feature to HP recovery skills.",
      "contextHash": "53fae00f53a71fc5a5aabccbdfb1429825e017cf78a66c41e85684a3aae85967"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＭＰ回復に適用（ApplyMpHeal）",
      "sourceHash": "a9be61fae81d139333d4882f9294d2063d12d1659da8a960ef62f764dd57357b",
      "translation": "Apply to MP Recovery (ApplyMpHeal)",
      "contextHash": "a9be61fae81d139333d4882f9294d2063d12d1659da8a960ef62f764dd57357b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＭＰ回復スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "bf652f095148272419ab210785e8e4f0f9487ddc211daa85859e9c8709157f2a",
      "translation": "Applies the assistance feature to MP recovery skills.",
      "contextHash": "bf652f095148272419ab210785e8e4f0f9487ddc211daa85859e9c8709157f2a"
    },
    {
