      "sourceHash": "66fb7d8d4917d378b914a05480c766a55a4f397dadacfea3e77da42acbda6411",
      "translation": "Apply to Revival (ApplyRevive)",
      "contextHash": "66fb7d8d4917d378b914a05480c766a55a4f397dadacfea3e77da42acbda6411"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "蘇生スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "cba16ae153333d96b5b529cc37167d8d3c91f13bd019e9076991bd23e8813539",
      "translation": "Applies the assistance feature to revival skills.",
      "contextHash": "cba16ae153333d96b5b529cc37167d8d3c91f13bd019e9076991bd23e8813539"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ステート解除に適用（ApplyRemoveState）",
      "sourceHash": "47aa6af71b01843fbe5fb9568e4e3bcaf4fd51174756ec262f2c374988ab742d",
      "translation": "Apply to State Removal (ApplyRemoveState)",
      "contextHash": "47aa6af71b01843fbe5fb9568e4e3bcaf4fd51174756ec262f2c374988ab742d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ステート（弱体）解除スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "4b27654caf71d5b8c5f030aae25fc1b50e9a8dbd942d178574836a2ffc4d78aa",
