  "texts": {
    "回復系スキル（アイテム）の選択時、自動的に最適な対象にカーソルが合わさるようにします。": "When selecting a healing skill (or item), the cursor automatically moves to the optimal target.",
    "回復スキルは最もＨＰ（％）が減っている対象を選択": "Healing skills select the target with the lowest HP (%)",
    "蘇生スキルは戦闘不能者を選択": "Revival skills select incapacitated allies",
    "ステート＆弱体の解除スキルは該当の対象を選択": "State and debuff removal skills select the applicable target",
    "なお、優先度は以下のようになっています。": "The priorities are as follows.",
    "蘇生＞ＨＰ回復＞ＭＰ回復＞ステート＆弱体解除": "Revive > HP Recovery > MP Recovery > Remove States & Debuffs",
    "例えば、ＨＰと毒を同時に回復できるスキルならば、毒ステートにかかっている対象ではなく、最もＨＰが減っている対象を優先して選択します。": "For example, if a skill can restore both HP and poison, it prioritizes the target with the lowest HP rather than a target affected by the poison state.",
    "目次": "Table of Contents",
    "導入方法（install）": "Installation (install)",
    "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the function ON in the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
    "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
    "NRP_HealAssist.js": "NRP_HealAssist.js ",
    "ver1.011（2025/07/22）": "ver1.011 (2025/07/22) ",
    "更新履歴（History）": "Update History (History)",
    "2025/06/17（ver1.01 -> 1.011）": "2025/06/17 (ver1.01 -> 1.011) ",
    "対象の選択優先度を下げる機能について、戦闘不能の敵が存在する場合に正しく機能しない不具合修正。（2025/07/22 ver1.011）": "Fixed a bug where the feature that lowers target selection priority did not function correctly when an incapacitated enemy was present. (2025/07/22 ver1.011)",
    "2024/12/09 -> 2025/06/03（ver1.00 -> 1.002）": "2024/12/09 -> 2025/06/03 (ver1.00 -> 1.002) ",
    "公開！": "Released!",
    "最大ＭＰ０のアクターがＭＰ回復のアシスト対象になってしまう不具合を修正。（2024/12/11 ver1.001）": "Fixed a bug where an actor with 0 maximum MP became a target for MP recovery assistance. (2024/12/11 ver1.001)",
    "範囲が味方単体（無条件）の蘇生スキルがアシスト対象にならない不具合修正。（2025/06/03 ver1.002）": "Fixed a bug where revival skills targeting a single ally (no conditions) did not become eligible for assistance. (2025/06/03 ver1.002)",
    "ステートのメモ欄（Note of State）": "State Note Field (Note of State)",
    "ステートにかかった対象の選択優先度を下げます。": "Lowers the selection priority of targets affected by the state.",
    "※選択自体は可能です。": "※The target can still be selected.",
    "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
    "ＨＰ回復に適用（ApplyHpHeal）": "Apply to HP Recovery (ApplyHpHeal)",
    "ＨＰ回復スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。": "Applies the assistance feature to HP recovery skills.",
    "ＭＰ回復に適用（ApplyMpHeal）": "Apply to MP Recovery (ApplyMpHeal)",
    "ＭＰ回復スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。": "Applies the assistance feature to MP recovery skills.",
    "蘇生に適用（ApplyRevive）": "Apply to Revival (ApplyRevive)",
    "蘇生スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。": "Applies the assistance feature to revival skills.",
    "ステート解除に適用（ApplyRemoveState）": "Apply to State Removal (ApplyRemoveState)",
    "ステート（弱体）解除スキルにアシスト機能を適用します。": "Applies the assistance feature to state (debuff) removal skills.",
    "戦闘画面に適用（ApplyBattle）": "Apply to Battle Screen (ApplyBattle)",
    "戦闘画面にてアシスト機能を適用します。": "Applies the assistance feature on the battle screen.",
    "メニュー画面に適用（ApplyMenu）": "Apply to Menu Screen (ApplyMenu)",
    "メニュー画面にてアシスト機能を適用します。": "Applies the assistance feature on the menu screen."
  }
